WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.150
- You got the job though.

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.460
I was telling you this in commercial.

00:00:02.460 --> 00:00:03.480
I love how you got your job.

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.220
You got it because of tweet, right?

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.160
- Yup. Actually...
- How did that happen?

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:08.950
- I didn't know how to
use Twitter back then.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:10.390
I didn't understand the differences

00:00:10.390 --> 00:00:12.310
between a retweet and a like.

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.010
Like, you know, when the
tweet actually came out,

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:17.300
it was actually my best
friend, Shahara Gasnabi,

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.890
still best friends with her today,

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:20.717
she screenshotted it and
sent it to me and was like,

00:00:20.717 --> 00:00:22.250
"Yo, yo, yo, let's do this."

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:23.083
And I was was like,

00:00:23.083 --> 00:00:24.890
"Eh, I think I wanna
take a nap right now."

00:00:24.890 --> 00:00:26.070
- It was Mindy Kaling, right?

00:00:26.070 --> 00:00:27.040
- Yep, Mindy's Tweet.

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:28.660
And I was like, "Okay,

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:29.890
I haven't hung out with her in a while,

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:30.723
let's do it."

00:00:30.723 --> 00:00:31.556
So we went to our-
- Mindy?

00:00:31.556 --> 00:00:32.389
- Yeah.

00:00:32.389 --> 00:00:33.222
So I was like...

00:00:33.222 --> 00:00:34.619
Yeah, oh, yeah, for sure.

00:00:34.619 --> 00:00:35.960
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:37.240
- You just hadn't hung
out with her in a minute?

00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:38.699
- Yeah, I hadn't hung out-
- Your friend.

00:00:38.699 --> 00:00:39.990
- My friend.

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:42.880
So, I went with my friend
to our community library

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:45.300
and that's where we filmed
it off of my mom's camera.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.517
And we were thinking, like,

00:00:46.517 --> 00:00:48.160
"Okay, this is like to the world.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:50.370
So anybody could audition
for this, right?"

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:51.203
- Yeah.

00:00:51.203 --> 00:00:52.620
- So we're like, "Eh, we'll
just give it the best shot

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:53.990
that, you know, we got."

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.430
And here we are. (chuckles)

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:57.930
- [Kelly] That's crazy. I love that.

